flowchart LR
  Browser --> Apache
  Apache --> FrontController[public/index.php]
  FrontController --> Router[routes/web.php + Router]
  Router --> Controller
  Controller --> Model
  Model --> PDO[Database::connection]
  PDO --> MySQL
  Controller --> View[View::render]
  View --> Template[PHP view + layout]
  Template --> Browser
  Template --> Assets[CSS + JavaScript]
